    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44742" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπερί-γρᾰφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to trace</i>
			or <i>sketch out</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.1.22
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				5.1.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>with a good outline</i> or <i>contour</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				10.13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ποδὸς τὸ μὴ εὐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dom.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φως</span>
			<i>by easy definition</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρῳ ὑποπεσεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>VP</u>
					29.159
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>concise</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλογισμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					2p.35U.
				</span></i>
			</div>
